php85 depends on zlib, which mysqlnd links directly.

--enable-mysqlnd keeps mysqlnd compression, which finds zlib with
pkg-config and puts -lz on the php, phpdbg and cgi link lines. The
recipe never declared zlib. NetBSD has it in base, but on macOS the
native php85 links the pkgsrc libz and its install stopped in
check-shlibs with "zlib-1.3.2nb2 is not a runtime dependency".
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); upstream status: not submitted.

--- a/lang/php85/Makefile.php
+++ b/lang/php85/Makefile.php
@@ -90,6 +90,8 @@
 SUBST_VARS.path+=	TOOLS_PATH.pkg-config PHP_PKGCONFIG_PATH
 
 .include "../../textproc/libxml2/buildlink3.mk"
+# mysqlnd compression links zlib.
+.include "../../devel/zlib/buildlink3.mk"
 
 #CONFIGURE_ARGS+=	--with-pcre-regex=${BUILDLINK_PREFIX.pcre2}
 
